# every writer of the four fields is known, each stores a boolean, and the objects stay with compiled code: four bytes in place of 32, and the cell is 32 bytes in place of 48.
# the pair beside them holds two booleans: a byte each would leave its cell at 32 bytes, so its slots stay as they are: a narrow slot costs instructions wherever it is read or stored by name.
# the four fields of the class whose objects reach code that nobody has seen hold any value: there a narrow form would be a type that nobody has proven.
